"\\n\\nNot Available.\\n\\n|Objective One: - Save the Negotiator\\n\\nA "
"member of the Institute's staff has volunteered to be used as a distraction "
"to help you get in. She will almost certainly be shot by dataDyne soldiers "
"unless you take out those soldiers quickly. Hit the ground "
"moving.\\n\\n|Objective Two: - Eliminate Rooftop Snipers\\n\\nAs soon as we "
"got the ransom demand, we did a recon overflight of the villa. An "
"examination of the data revealed that there are several snipers on the "
